    {
      "style": "PortfolioLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL PORTFOLIO / ALEX ROWAN"
    },
    {
      "style": "PortfolioLabel",
      "text": "CASE 01 / DRAFT COMMUNICATION"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Reading-club handout"
    },
    {
      "style": "PortfolioNote",
      "text": "AI concept illustration; not a project photograph. The editable excerpt below is the supplied work…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "SUPPLIED EXCERPT / 3 STEPS"
    },
    {
      "style": "PortfolioExcerpt",
      "text": "Choose one short passage. Mark one detail you noticed. Bring one question to the conversation."
    },
    {
      "style": "PortfolioNote",
      "text": "Original example wording. No actual programme, participants or reading session is documented."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "A clear way to begin"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The fictional brief asks for a small preparation task that does not require a finished interpretation."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Sample contribution"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Draft wording and sequence. A programme lead would still confirm the activity, date and access…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "The choice in the draft"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Three concrete verbs give a visible order: choose, mark, bring. The last step makes room for a question."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "What the excerpt shows"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "One editable draft with three steps. It shows the proposed wording and order; it does not show how…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "What remains unknown"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "There are no field-test records. Clear wording alone cannot establish comprehension, inclusive…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Evidence to seek next"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Ask the actual organiser to verify the activity. Then ask intended readers to explain what they would do."
    },
    {
      "style": "PortfolioNote",
      "text": "Example draft only. No deployment, audience response or measured result."
    },
    {
      "style": "PortfolioLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL PORTFOLIO / ALEX ROWAN"
    },
    {
      "style": "PortfolioLabel",
      "text": "CASE 02 / DRAFT SERVICE INFORMATION"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Tool-library notice"
    },
    {
      "style": "PortfolioNote",
      "text": "AI concept illustration; not a project photograph. The editable excerpt below is the supplied work…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "SUPPLIED EXCERPT / 3 ACTIONS"
    },
    {
      "style": "PortfolioExcerpt",
      "text": "BORROW / Check the current borrowing rules. ASK / Contact the service team about the tool you need.…"
    },
    {
      "style": "PortfolioNote",
      "text": "Original example wording. Actual service rules, contact details and return arrangements are unverified."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Organise by next action"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The fictional brief asks for a short notice that separates borrowing, help and returns without…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Sample contribution"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Draft headings and information order. A service coordinator would still verify eligibility, hours,…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "The choice in the draft"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Group the notice by a person’s next action. Leave unknown procedures visible instead of filling them…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "What the excerpt shows"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "One editable draft separates three actions. It supports a discussion of wording and order, not a claim…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "What remains unknown"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "There are no field-test records. The draft cannot show fewer questions, safer tool use or a working…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Evidence to seek next"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Confirm the real service details and contact route. Review the completed notice with intended readers…"
    },
    {
      "style": "PortfolioNote",
      "text": "Example draft only. Not an operational notice or verified service instruction."
    },
    {
      "style": "PortfolioLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL PORTFOLIO / ALEX ROWAN"
    },
    {
      "style": "PortfolioLabel",
      "text": "AFTER THE INTERVIEW"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Evidence, then conversation."
    },
    {
      "style": "PortfolioLead",
      "text": "2 draft excerpts. 0 field-test records."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "For a fictional communications hiring panel: use these cases to discuss choices about instructions and…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "What to inspect"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Case 01 / Does the sequence give a clear first action? Case 02 / Does the notice keep service…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "A bounded claim"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The supplied native excerpts are original demonstration material. They are not a real candidate’s work…"
    },
    {
      "style": "PortfolioNote",
      "text": "The photographic-looking still lifes are AI concept illustrations. Neither image is a project record or…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "A useful next conversation"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "The proposed next step"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Discuss one draft choice, its constraint and the evidence needed before real use. This is a sample…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Sources and permissions"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Original fictional text and illustrative assets are supplied with this template. Replace them with your…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Evidence to add"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "For a real case, add the source artifact, date or “unknown,” your exact role, collaborators, version,…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Read in two to five minutes"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Begin with either case. Inspect its actual excerpt, then read the contribution, limit and next step.…"
    },
    {
      "style": "PortfolioNote",
      "text": "No real employer, client, appointment, endorsement or contact route is asserted."
    }
